# One domain per vendor service, with the transition init needs to leave u:r:init:s0.
#
# Every domain here is permissive, deliberately and temporarily. Global permissive is not
# a substitute: a service started with no transition runs AS init, so servicemanager
# registration and lookup misbehave and keystore2 cannot reach keymint. Per-domain
# permissive gives each service its correct identity while the allow rules are still
# being written from real denials.
#
# Remove the permissive lines as each domain's rules are filled in.

type ambience_hub_default, domain;
init_daemon_domain(ambience_hub_default)
permissive ambience_hub_default;

